  "description": "Boston Western is a bold vintage cowboy display font inspired by classic American western typography. With its strong slab-style characters and retro saloon aesthetic, this font perfectly captures the spirit of the wild west. It is ideal for western-themed designs, vintage posters, logos, branding, apparel, packaging, signage, and rustic projects. Boston Western brings an authentic cowboy vibe that makes your design stand out with a timeless frontier style.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Boston Western is a bold vintage cowboy display font inspired by classic American western typography. With its strong slab-style characters and retro saloon aesthetic, this font perfectly captures the spirit of the wild west. It is ideal for western-themed designs, vintage posters, logos, branding, apparel, packaging, signage, and rustic projects. Boston Western brings an authentic cowboy vibe that makes your design stand out with a timeless frontier style.</p>",
